    </release>
    <release version="1.0.0~rc.2" date="2026-10-10" type="development">
      <url>https://github.com/Neisvestney/qw-cat/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.2</url>

      <description>
        <ul>
          <li>Cache extracted audio tracks and playback copies in the user cache directory instead of the shared temp directory</li>
          <li>Store downloaded ffmpeg in the app data directory so it is removed together with app data on uninstall</li>
          <li>Migrate previously downloaded ffmpeg and clean up the old temp directory automatically</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
    <release version="1.0.0~rc.1" date="2026-10-10" type="development">
      <url>https://github.com/Neisvestney/qw-cat/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.1</url>

      <description>
        <ul>
          <li>macOS support (Apple Silicon and Intel)</li>
          <li>New export wizard with built-in and custom presets and audio settings</li>
          <li>Hardware-accelerated encoding</li>
          <li>Settings dialog</li>
          <li>Recent videos on the start page</li>
          <li>Playback volume control and improved separate audio tracks playback</li>
          <li>Remux videos for playback when needed</li>
          <li>Verify ffmpeg download integrity</li>
          <li>Token auth for the integrated server</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
